;
; A UART for the PD mini (../include/pdmini.h), 8N1, on any two pins:
; transmit and receive as two state machines, eight cycles a bit.
; pd_uart.c attaches them to the pins for one transaction only; between
; transactions the pins are pulled-down inputs, so the transmit line never
; idles high into an unpowered module.
;
; The two programs are the pico-examples' uart_tx and uart_rx, the receiver
; without the framing-error interrupt this firmware has no use for.
;
; Copyright (c) 2020 Raspberry Pi (Trading) Ltd.
;
